ÉO Ksenopoulos mas prosphere polla thaumasia erga. Alla to "Phantasma" isos einai to pio prototupo. Mia protakouste istoria, pou diadramatisteke to IEaiona ste Benetokratoumene Zakuntho, ten opoia o megalos suggrapheas te meteplase se muthistorema, apo ta oraiotera tou eidous tou. Ten ekame ergo tekhnes sto opoio e panemorphe kai tragike eroida tou katakta monime these sten kardia mas."à
ÖMesa sten omikhle ton elbetikon Alpeon, stenetai e pagida pou tha metatrepsei to oneiro mias gunaikas se ephialte.
E Margko, mia Ellenida antiker ste metapolemike Geneue, brisketai antimetope me mia musteriode upothese phonon, me thumata tous mnesteres tes kaluteres tes philes.
Sten prospatheia tes na te boethesei, e Margko xekinaei mia epikindune periplanese sta bathia alpika dase, ekhontas sto pleuro tes ton goeteutiko pastora Serz.
Psakhnontas ten aletheia piso apo mia skoteine erotike istoria, tha odegethei sto sale enos paranoikou orologopoiou kai tes ainigmatikes meteras tou, tha egklobistei sto ereipomeno kastro pou krubei enan phugodiko Nazi kai, anapopheukta, tha anagkastei na akolouthesei ta bemata tous sta skoteina monopatia tou mualou kai tes psukhes."ä
áApo to plousiospito tes Biennes opou megalose mekhri to mikro petrino spiti se ena khorio tes dutikes Manes, e Elene, akolouthontas antistrophe poreia ap' auten tou pappou kai tou patera tes, pragmatopoiei to pio duskolo taxidi, mesa stous kindunous kai stis katastrophes pou prokalei o pio aneleetos polemos pou gnorise e anthropoteta.
Ekhontas mekhri tote boleutei ste routina mias anetes kathemerinotetas, tha diabei ta monopatia tes agonias kai tou phobou otan katalabei oti o monos tropos gia na sothoun e monakribe kore tes, o gampros tes kai o poluagapemenos tes eggonos einai na parei to paidi kai na drapeteusoun apo ten Austria.
Me kainourgia tautoteta, agnoste akome kai stous dikous tes, tha egkatastathei me ton eggono tes sten Patra kai tha palepsei gia ten epibiose mesa sten Katokhe khoris na gnorizei tipota gia ten tukhe ton dikon tes.
Sta laspomena pedia ton makhon, sta stratopeda sugkentroses, sta krateteria tes Gkestapo, sta mploka kai stis ekteleseis, stis eroikes praxeis antistases tha dei na anametrontai idees, arkhes, axies, na thusiazontai anthropoi pou agonizontai.
S' aute te duskole periodo tha diapistosei ten euteleia oson nomize semantika kai tha xaphniastei apo ten axia ton mikron, kathemerinon pragmaton. Kurios omos tha gnorisei ton eauto tes kai, apeleutheromene apo sumbaseis kai phobous, tha niosei gemate apo enan plouto pou kanenas pote den tha mporesei na tes steresei."ã
àKathe Kuriake o khrusaetos katebaine apo ton Olumpo, pernouse pano apo ten pole tes Katerines kai sten sunekheia ekane boltes sten odo Paralias. Etan megalos san ena mikro aeroplano. Oi megaloi elegan oti epsakhne te gunaika tou kai to gio tou, eno ta mikra paidia thaumazan ta akrobatika kai ta aeroplanika kolpa pou ekane.
E mikre Elene pisteue oti o aetos erkhotan mono gia keine kai oti kapoia mera tha ten epairne sta phtera tou. Mia Kuriake duo antres me ena autokineto apagagoun te mikte Elene. O aetos parakolouthei to autokineto kai ste Lukoporia kataphernei kai pairnei te mikre Elene sta phtera tou kai khanontai ston Olumpo. O kosmos leei oti o aetos troei paidia kai arkhizoun na ton kunegoun. Astunomia kai elikoptera tou stratou psakhnoun na skotosoun ton aeto. E mikre Elene omos ton agapaei kai einai etoime na thusiastei gia na ton glitosei apo ta kheria tes Astunomias kai tou stratou."ç
äO Mpen einai pleon dekaokhto khronon -ena dustukhismeno ktenos pou prospathei na prosarmostei sten anthropine koinonia kai na epibiosei. Peristoikhismenos apo ligostous philous, pou theloun na ton boethesoun, kai pollous ekhthrous, pou epikheiroun na ton ekmetalleutoun, o Mpen anakaluptei kathemerina poso duskole einai e zoe gia olous ekeinous pou me opoiandepote tropo einai diaphoretikoi apo tous allous. Me mia lite alla sunarpastike aphegese, e Ntoris Lesingk epistrephei ston eroa tou muthistorematos tes To pempto paidi, olokleronontas epeita apo polla khronia mia istoria pou agapetheke idiaitera apo ekatommuria anagnostes s' olo ton kosmo."í
èO tapeinos graphias pou anelabe na perigrapse ton megalo eroa Milona Phirike, prin arkhise na existore ta tromera tou katorthomata, theorei upokhreose na parathese ten perigraphe tou en logon prosopou, akeraia kai akribestate. Dioti ama arkhises kai grapheis o, ti theleis, sou leei o allos "toutos do ta bgazei ap' ten koilia tou" kai kammia ektimese den ekhei mete se sena, mete ston eroa. Ki o anthropos semera sten koinonia gia mian ekhtimese ze. Nomizoume; Ekrithe, loipon, aparaiteton na poume ole te zoe tou Phirike, prin mpoume sto psakhno. Einai toso alethine, oso - ti na poume; - oi programmatikes deloseis upopsephion politeuton. Kai den tha paraleipsoume to paramikro, prokeimenou na ton kanoume apoluta gnosto stous thaumastes tou. (. . .) (APO TON PROLOGO TES EKDOSES)"ó
îApo ten kathemerine zoe mekhri ton kosmo ton epikheireseon, e philosophia tou Nitse mporei na apodeikhthei exairetika apotelesmatikos sumboulos se kathe duskole stigme. Sta 99 kephalaia tou bibliou autou o Allan Persu sugkentronei tis pio kairies skepseis tou megalou philosophou, deikhnontas pos mporoume na tis axiopoiesoume se kathe stigme tes zoes. Mas boethaei na pairnoume apophaseis, na anaktoume to tharros mas, na xanabriskoume te soste poreia mas, na stathmizoume te semasia ton oson mas sumbainoun ste diarkeia tes meras."ô
ñEna erotas gennietai mesa apo tis selides mias allelographias. Ena ergo eugenikes pnoes, pou den ekhei kamia skhese me muthous. Mia istoria pallomenes zoes, aletheias kai dunamikou erotikou sunaisthematos, pou zetaei antapokrise gia na gonimopoiethei kai na pherei ten eutukhia."§
°A strange assortment of characters inhabit these poems, including George Mackay Brown, Johnny Cash, William Dampier, a lion-keeper in wartime Afganistan, and a shipload of sailors in a Shetland churchyard. The long central work of the collection provides an elegiac meditation on the life and death of a young soldier who succumbed to hypothermia during the Napoleonic Wars. Finally, and quite unexpectedly, the poem "Googlisms" provides an outpouring of quirky definitions from a website that collects information from the search engine Google."¶

£
Pes! Ekheis perpatesei pote se kapoion eparkhiako dromo tes kentrikes Boemias ena septembriatiko proino; O khamelos, omikhlodes, apopniktikos ouranos moiazei me bromike gkriza tenta trupemene apo tis maramenes, okhres kastanies, pou plaisionoun ton bathia rutidiasmeno apo trokhous kaphe dromo. O kokkinos elios ekhei skepasei to pnigmeno sten katakhnia prosopo tou me pukna pepla* merikes treles akhtides glistroun pano apo ton sunnephenio toikho kai rikhnoun kitrines, leptes grammes sta perittomata sto dromo. Enas dusthumos anemos striphogurizei ta kitrina phulla pera dothe kai dialuei ton araio kapno pou phainetai na bgainei erpontas ap' tis makrines steges tou khoriou - mia eikona aneipotes, aperigraptes, abastakhtes thlipses. Opote skephtomai aute ten eikona, aisthanomai ena megalo pono konta sten kardia mou. Kati skirta - kai trabaei, trabaei ospou dakrua kaine sta matia mou... E idia aisthese xupna mesa mou otan skephtomai te phtokhe gunaika, pou ten istoria tes thelo na sou diegetho. Akou!
Dekatessera diegemata tou Rainer Maria Rilke, istories erota kai thanatou, sophias kai alazoneias, elpidas kai eleutherias, mustikismou kai ekstases, mataiotetas kai pistes. Dekatessera impresionistika peza, sta opoia xekheilizei o ruthmos kai e mousikoteta tes glossas tou megaluterou poiete tes Austrias."©
¶Basismeno se pragmatika biographika gegonota, to "Ntrount" exereuna ta aluta akoma musteria ton skoteinon teleutaion emeron tou Karolou Ntikens se mia bathia prototupe istoria pou epaletheuei to kharakterismo tou suggraphea Dan Simmons os "giganta tes suggraphes".
Ntrount
...einai to onoma kai o ephialtes pou katatrukhei ton Karolo Ntikens ta teleutaia pente khronia tes zoes tou.
Stis 9 Iouniou, 1865, o Ntikens kai e eromene tou epistrephoun krupha sto Londino, otan to treno tous pephtei se ena keno ste siderodromike gramme. Ola ta bagonia tes protes theses gkremizontai sten koilada apo kato, ektos apo ekeino tou Ntikens. Otan o Ntikens katebainei sten koilada gia na phrontisei tous nekrous kai tous etoimothanatous, e zoe tou allazei gia panta. Kai sten kardia autou tou ephialte pou tha kratesei pente khronia einai...
Ntrount...
to onoma pou o Ntikens psithurizei ston philo tou Gouilki Kolins. Enas exartemenos apo to labdano kai ligotero epitukhemenos suggrapheas, o Kolins periphronei tis euaisthesies tes biktorianes epokhes kai zei me te mia eromene tou kai kanei paidi me mia alle, alla isos einai o monadikos anthropos ste Ge me ton opoio o Ntikens mporei na moirastei to mustiko tou...
Ntrount. Me ten olo kai auxanomene emmone tou gia tis kruptes kai ta nekrotapheia, o Ntikens stamata na graphei gia tessera khronia kai peripheretai stis kheiroteres phtokhogeitonies kai katakombes tou Londinou te nukhta, eno pragmatopoiei demosies anagnoseis te mera, makabries anagnoseis pou tromokratoun to koino tou. Telika xekina na graphei auto pou tha ginotan to proto megalo aristourgematiko muthistorema musteriou, To Musterio tou Entouin Ntrount, an den diakoptotan gia panta apo ton..."Ø
¨Mia gunaika timoretheke. To apodekhetai. Kai metatrepei mone tes ten timoria se isobia: ten "akinesia". Mia gunaika-"stasis". Kai guro tes e boue kai ta pathe, na ta ripizei e trela metamphiesmene se amerimno pouli. E kore tes, os epanastase gia ten timoria, metamphiezei me pseudonumo ten pole pou adikese te metera tes, epithetei pseudonumo kai ston eauto tes, baphtizetai "Raraou" kai katapheugoun prosphuges sten proteuousa. Thuma, kai okhi eroida tou bibliou autou, e Raraou egkathistatai sto Melodrama kai sto Komiko. Ten anagkasan na pistepsei oti den tes epitrepetai na einai tragike, ta pathe tes den anerkhontai se epipedo megaloprepeias. Telika, omos, e Tragodia, esto kai me spasmene kothorno, ten episkeptetai kai te muronei. Guro stis duo gunaikes, thole sto bathos mia khora adespote. Kai prosopa polla, pou pisteuoun oti o kosmos demiourgetheke os proskhema gia na ginoun biblia ta dika tous pathe. Kata te diadrome tou bibliou, oi loipoi katoikoi tou bathmiaia eutukhoun kai egkataleipoun esukhasmenoi kai to biblio kai te Raraou. E khora paramenei thole kai akinete sto perithorio tou bibliou. To opoio biblio den antekhei na parakolouthesei te Raraou os to telos tes: lipotakhtei, ten egkataleipei na sunekhisei mone tes. Telikos, lathos mou pou ten apokalesa thuma. Aphou alloste mone tes delonei eutukhes kai epitukhemene. Den gnorizo ti apegine e Raraou.
P. M.
"Ste "Metera tou skulou", opos o Phokner ste "Boue kai to pathos", o Matesis dinei to logo stous ptokhous to pneumati... ergo exairetika dunato..."
(L. Farnoux, "Le Monde")
""E metera tou skulou"... e zoe ekregnutai san bomba... apeires einai oi skenes pou tha thumomaste..."
(C. Segre, "Corriere Della Sera")
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
E metera tou skulou tou Paulou Matesi, kuklophorese apo tis Ekdoseis Kastaniote se eidike sullektike ekdose, se arithmemena dermatodeta antitupa upogegrammena apo ton suggraphea. To ergo, pou protokuklophorese to 1990 kai paramenei ektote ena apo ta eklekta muthistoremata ton Ellenon alla kai ton xenon anagnoston, ekhei pragmatopoiesei ede sten Ellada penenta ekdoseis, ekhei metaphrastei se dekatreis glosses kai ekhei apospasei euloga ten katholike anagnorise tou bibliophilikou koinou. Prosphata, malista, sugkatalekhtheke apo ton londreziko ekdotiko oiko Quintet Publishing sta 1001 biblia tes pagkosmias logotekhnias ta opoia opheilei na ekhei diabasei kathe anthropos mekhri to telos tes zoes tou (ston tomo 1001 Books You Must Read Before You Die)."∞
≠To <>diegema Ena gluko koritsi protodemosieuteke to Noembrio tou 1876 sto periodiko <>, pou exedide o idios o Ntostogiephski. Basizetai se mia alethine istoria pou sunebe tote sten Petroupole. Ena apo ta megalutera diegemata tou, ena klasiko aristourgema.
Einai o monologos enos anthropou mprosta sto ptoma tes gunaikas tou, pou autoktonese prin apo ligo. Autos o anthropos, prospathontas na dosei mia exegese sto gegonos, arkhizei n' anathumatai te skhese tous kai sugkhronos kanei apologismo tes zoes tou. Tupikos ntostogiephskikos eroas, talanteuetai diarkos metaxu tou kalou kai tou kakou. Telika, oi anamneseis pou zontaneuoun mesa tou ton odegoun anapopheukta sten aletheia kai ten autognosia.
O Ntostogiephski, megas anatomos tes psukhes, pairnei aphorme apo ena pragmatiko gegonos kai khtizei aristotekhnika mia istoria sten opoia milaei gia te moira ton anthropon me ten katanoese poi oi idioi adunatoun na deixoun o enas ston allo."≤
ØTheoroumene to aristourgema tou Milan Kountera, "E abastakhte elaphroteta tou Einai" akolouthei ta megala protupa tou muthistorematos-dokimiou, topothetontas te drase sten Praga tes dekaetias tou 1960, ton zopheroteron khronon tou tsekhoslobakikou kommounistikou kathestotos. Erotas kai ideologia, autapates kai diapseuseis sunantiountai kai sugkrouontai se ena pedio dunameon anamphisbeteta katapiestiko, opou e lakhtara gia ten eleutheria kai gia mia diaspase tes uparxes "elaphrotere" pairnei dramatika ten opse mias prosmones katadikasmenes sten apotukhia.
E istoria tou erota anamesa ton Tomas, giatro kai proen kommouniste alla akome uliste, kai sten Tereza, dosmene antitheta ste sullogistike mias "psukhes" pros anazetese, ginetai eukola to upodeigma gia oles tis asunennoesies kai tis melagkholies pou mporoun na anaduthoun otan o erotas ginetai kata proto logo bolidoskopese proorismene na buthometresei tis abussous tes idias mas tes dustukhias.
Oi prodosies kai oi egkataleipseis, oi sugkrouseis kai oi sumphilioseis prokuptoun apo ten prospatheia phuges apo mia aletheia tes uparxes, pou o suggrapheas ten proseggizei se asunethisto bathos, mia aletheia pou einai isos adunato, oso kai an paskhisei kaneis, na ten apodekhtei, os to eskhato orio tes.
Alla to thauma pou sunteleitai apo ton Kountera sunistatai sto oti ola auta mas ta prospherei me apisteuta analaphro kheirismo, me ena epikhrisma khamogelastes eironeias, e opoia khoris na eutelizei ta sumphrazomena, petukhainei na mas kanei na aisthanthoume oti e upothese aphora olous mas.
(ephemerida "La Repubblica")"µ
≤Mia kaute kalokairine nukhta tou 1909, o Zigkmount Phroint apobibazetai ste Nea Uorke mazi me ton antagoniste tou, Karl Gioungk. Anamesa se osous ton upodekhontai einai ki o doktor Stratkham Giangker, talantoukhos giatros ki enas apo tous pio enthermous uposteriktes tou. Ki etsi arkhizei e monadike episkepse tou patera tes psukhanaluses sten Amerike.
To proi meta ten aphixe tou Phroint, s' ena retire tes poles, mia panemorphe neare gunaika brisketai dolophonemene. Ten epomene, e atithase kleronomos Nora Akton meta bias glitonei apo to na ginei to deutero thuma tou dolophonou.
Enonontas tis dunameis tou me to demarkho, ton ekkentriko iatrodikaste tes poles kai to nearo astunomiko epitheorete Tzimi Litlmor, o Giangker summetekhei se mia ereuna pou apokaluptei te dikhasmene psukhe mias metropoles sto katophli mias biaies neas epokhes.
E "Ermeneutike tou phonou" einai ena apolaustiko biblio me peritekhne, kalouphasmene ploke gemate anapantekhes ekplexeis, epidexies anatropes kai sunarpastikes idees, kai sematodotei ten emphanise enos exairetikou neou suggraphea."ø
ºStratopedo sugkentroses Bestkhophen.
Ligo prin xespasei o B' Pagkosmios polemos.
Ephta kratoumenoi drapeteuoun. Sto stratopedo semainei sunagermos. Oi perissoteroi sullambanontai. O skleropurenikos dioiketes Pharenmpergk diatazei na kopoun ephta platania kai na ginoun ephta stauroi. Oi exi sullephthentes stauronontai. O ebdomos stauros, omos, menei kenos.
O Gkeorgk Khaisler, o drapetes pou diapheugei tes sullepses, akrobatei metaxu zoes kai thanatou. E apodrase tou bazei sto stokhastro tou nazistikou kathestotos ta agapemena tou prosopa. Mia oloklere mikre koinonia kaleitai na plerosei en meso apeilon, anakriseon kai basanisterion, to timema tes anthropines eleutherias.
Ergo emblematiko ston agona enantia se kathe morphe oloklerotismou, O ebdomos stauros sugkatalegetai sta koruphaia erga tes logotekhnias tes exorias."Õ
 E duadike upostase tou Khristou statheke gia mena panta bathu, anexereuneto musterio. E lakhtara, e toso anthropine, e toso uperanthrope, na phtasei o anthropos os to theo - e pio sosta: na epistrepsei o anthropos sto Theo kai na tautistei mazi tou. E nostalgia aute, e toso mustike kai sunama toso pragmatike, anoige mesa mou pleges kai pleges megales. Apo te neoteta mou e protarkhike mou agonia, apo opou pegazan oles oi khares kai oles mou oi pikres, etan toute: e akatapaute, anelee pale anamesa sto pnema kai ste sarka. Mesa pampalaies anthropines kai proanthropines photeres dunames tou Theou ki psukhe mou etan e palaistra pou oi duo toutoi stratoi khtupiountan ki esmigan. Agonia megale, agapousa to soma mou kai den ethela na khathei, agapousa ten psukhe mou kai den ethela na xepesei makhomoun na philioso tis duo autes antidromes kosmogonikes dunames, na niosoun pos den einai okhtroi, einai sunergates kai na kharoun, na kharo ki ego mazi tous, ten armonia."—
ŒLiving with OCD is not for sissies. J.J. Keeler proves that. From her fears of the bomb in her teddy bear, to her fear of having run over innocent pedestrians, to her fear that she has killed her waiter, she tells her story in a way that allows us to see inside her disease and to see that she has not lost her sense of humor. This light-hearted yet serious and comforting look at OCD lets some light into the closet of sufferers. This book is for those with OCD, those who love someone with OCD, and for those who would like to know what it's like to live with the daily challenges of OCD."€
ÿEna ergo diaphoretikotero apo ta gnosta erga tou suggraphea. Mia ploke dunaton erotikon sugkrouseon enos andra anamesa se treis gunaikes. Ena dilemma ston eroa tou ergou. Na parameinei pistos ste gunaika tou e na sundesei te zoe tou me ten kata polu mikrotere tou Tina, pou kuriolektika ton ekhei xemualisei me ten trupheroteta tes elikias tes;"‹

Ÿ
E Zelikha Kazantzi apophasise prin apo eikosi khronia na pherei ste zoe ten exogame kore tes Asia kai na kratesei mustiko to onoma tou patera. E Asia megalonei sto idio spiti me te metera te giagia tes ten progiagia tes kai tis treis theies tes. Tesseris genies gunaikon ton Kazantzi zoun mazi se ena konaki tes Konstantinoupoles aphou oi antres tes oikogeneias pethainoun se neare elikia. Aute e katara alloste eikhe anagkasei ton Moustapha to monadiko aderpho tes Zelikha na egkataleipsei ten Tourkia kai na egkatastathei sten Amerike opou kai pantreuteke ten Amerikanida Roouz proen suzugo Armeniou tes diasporas melos polumelous oikogeneias prosphugon kai metera tes neares Armanous. Otan e Armanous apophasizei na anazetesei tis armenikes rizes tes taxideuei krupha sten Konstantinoupole kai philoxeneitai sto spiti ton Kazantzi. Ginetai phile me ten Asia tes milaei gia te genoktonia ton Armenion pou e tourkike istoria aposiopa eno e mantissa theia tes Asia e Mpanous taxideuei parea me to tzini tes sto khrono kai anakaluptei mustika kai tragodies pou exegoun polla...
Gia to biblio auto e Saphak kategoretheke gia <>dusphemese tes tourkikes ethnikes tautotetas basei tou arthrou 301 tou Tourkikou Poinikou Kodika. E polubrabeumene suggrapheas pou prothese tes etan na erthoun pio konta o tourkikos me ton armeniko lao apallakhteke telika apo ten kategoria.
<>."‚
ﬂFor years, Selina Kyle has prowled the skyline of Gotham City as its most famous thief, Catwoman. But when word spreads of Catwoman's demise, Selina decides to leave the costumed world behind and continue her trade cloaked in the shadows. Unable to enjoy her newfound anonymity for too long though, Selina decides that she must return to her infamous persona. Donning a new costume and attitude, Catwoman returns to the streets and sets her sights on the serial killer that has been preying upon the streetwalkers she calls friends.
This volume collects in chronological order an entire Catwoman epic from multiple award-winning creators Darwyn Cooke & Ed Brubaker.
Collecting: Catwoman1-9, Selina's Big Score & Detective Comics759-762"‚	
ﬂ	O Giokhan Bolphgkangk phon Gkaite (1749-1832), pezographos, poietes kai zographos, alla kai philosophos kai biologos kai phusikos, einai kata genike omologia e megalophuIa pou sphragise te germanike logotekhnia. Ta erga tou doxasan ten poiese kai ten pezographia, te philosophia kai tis thetikes epistemes, an kai o idios, stis arkhes tes stadiodromias tou, pisteue pos to pragmatiko tou talento briskotan ste zographike.
Khronia oneireuotan kai khronia skhediaze to athanato aristourgema tou, ton Phaoust. Oi palioteres morphes tou ergou, pou einai gnostes san Proto-Phaoust, proerkhontai apo to diastema 1772-1775, omos to a meros den oloklerotheke prin apo to 1806. Akolouthese e demosieuse tou to 1808, eno e anatheoremene ekdose tou 1828-9 uperxe kai e oristike. To b meros oloklerotheke to 1832, etos thanatou tou Gkaite, pou den prolabe na to dei tupomeno.
Parolo pou o Phaoust etan proorismenos na diabastei, kata monas e se theatrika analogia, paramenei to pio polupaigmeno ergo sta theatra tes Germanias. Oso gia ton kharismatiko demiourgo tou, pou egine pege empneuses gia poietes, mousourgous, zographous kai philosophous, mono mia elpida eikhe sto telos tes zoes tou: na ton thumountai kapote os suggraphea tes Theorias ton khromaton."„
‡To teleutaio kai eskhato muthistorema tou W. G. Sebald, enos apo tous pio idiaiterous suggrapheis tes epokhes mas, aphegeitai ten Istoria tou Zak Aousterlits, enos antra pou otan etan paidi steretheke patrida, glossa kai onoma, kai pou tora den mporei na aisthanthei oikeia pouthena ston kosmo kai anazeta apegnosmena ten tautoteta tes katagoges tou.
Mesa ste skoteine aithousa tou siderodromikou stathmou tes Ambersas, etsi arkhizei te diegese o aphegetes, stekotan enas antras: me opse neanike, xanthos, me baries arbules pezoporias, mple ergatiko panteloni ki ena palio sakidio, aporrophemenos na semeionei kai na skhediazei s' ena tetradio. O aphegetes ton paraterei goeteumenos, ki etsi arkhizei mia skhese pou ton mageuei olo kai perissotero kai diarkei dekaeties, allote pio stene, allote pio apomakrusmene.
O ainigmatikos xenos onomazetai Aousterlits, kai kathos e tukhe kanei tous duo antres na sunantiountai anapantekha se diaphora mere, arkhizei na apokaluptetai bema bema e Istoria tes zoes autou tou monakhikou periegete. O Aousterlits, pou zei khronia sto Londino, den einai Agglos. Te dekaetia tou '40, mikro Ebraiopoulo, ephtase sten Oualia kai megalose s' ena mikro khorio sto spiti anthropon elikiomenon, enos Ierokeruka kai tes gunaikas tou. To paidi megalonei monakhika, ki otan epeita apo polla khronia mathainei ten pragmatike katagoge kai to onoma tou, katalabainei giati aisthanetai xenos anamesa stous anthropous.
O B. Gk. Zempalnt akolouthei ten Istoria enos diataragmenou kai eualotou dianooumenou, enos xerizomenou, pou den mporei na brei ten patrida tou mesa stous anthropous. O suggrapheas egeirei ena eidos antimnemeiou gia olous ekeinous oi opoioi, ste diarkeia tes Istorias, brethekan kunegemenoi, ektopismenoi, apokommenoi apo tis rizes tous - dikhos pote na katalaboun ten aitia olon auton.
Aute e trototeta, epia kai mustike, pou kharakterizei ton Zempalnt kai ta xekhorista prosopa ton muthistorematon tou, o tropos tous na uparkhoun talanteuomena anamesa sten oraioteta tou kosmou kai sten odune pou o kosmos autos genna, eggraphoun ta erga tou suggraphea ste sullogike mneme os exekhonta semeia anaphoras."È
ÊThis volume shows the reader the means by which a "man of power" sees, as opposed to merely looking, & how by his concentrated "seeing" he can, indeed must, "stop the world." In it, Carlos Castaneda describes the lessons, the omens, the exercises of the will & body, the arduous trials & tests, the simple yet mysterious demonstrations, the extraordinary visions & experiences by which don Juan, his mentor & friend, prepares him for the task of perceiving things as they are, instead of describing them by the words, conventions & standards of conventional, a priori ideas & language. Here, in the high mountains & in the bright arid desert, Castaneda reaches for power in a series of startling encounters with the unknown--a confrontation with death & the past in the form of an albino falcon, with the twilight wind, with a flesh-&-blood mountain lion, with a mountain fog--& learns the techniques, the concentration, the compassion of the hunter, the man who is "without routines, free, fluid.""Ú
ÔAutos o tupos, skhedon trianta khronia ethelousia apokleismenos se duo domatia, ena sten Kato Kephisia kai ena sten Parga, mou eikhe anoixei parathura se olo ton kosmo. Me eikhe paei ste Ge ton Besigotthon, sto Mexiko, sto Katmantou, sto Mets kai sto Porto Riko, mazi eikhame stesei odophragmata sto Parisi tou Mae tou '68, eikhame anebei sto karo mazi me te Roza Louxempourgk, salparame sto tsourmo tou Sebakh, apo to Taz Makhal os to Ntepo ki apo ten Parga os ten plateia Khorkhe nt' Albarado."ı
ÚMeine Ehre Heissst Treue explores the iconic artifacts, uniforms and insignia which underpinned the concept and philosophy behind Hitler s Third Reich in general, and Himmler s Allgemeine-SS in particular. Formed in 1925 as a personal protection unit for Adolf Hitler, while under the control of Himmler (1929-1945), the Allgemeine-SS grew from a small paramilitary group to one of the most powerful, complex organizations in the Third Reich.Today the Allgemeine-SS is equally enigmatic; as the vehicle by which Himmler proposed to implement his thesis to create a Center of the New World; its structure, and psychology remains little-understood. Authored by leading militaria specialists Ulric of England, Meine Ehre Heissst Treue extends deep inside the Allgemeine-SS to reveal an unsurpassed creativity and philosophy. From the iconic, black SS uniform designed by Prof. Karl Diebitsch, graphic designer Walter Heck (and manufacturer Hugo Boss), to the applied arts, for example the first born mother s brooch and Allach porcelain flower vase, this authoritative book, presents the most distinguished Allgemeine-SS collection to date.""¸

