O Diplos anthropos grapheke apo ton Ntostogiephski to 1845, alla, an kai muthistorema, periekhei polles psukhanalutikes diapistoseis pou prooionizontai auta pou eipe stis arkhes tou 20ou aiona o Phrount. Kentrike tou idea einai o dikhasmos tes prosopikotetas, pou xekinaei os lanthanousa astheneia (ena eidos manias katadioxes), kai katalegei sten plere sugkrouse ton duo ego kai sten telike tragike diaspase. Tessera khronia prin grapsei auto to ergo, o Ntostogiephski eikhe gnorisei ton giatro Rizenkampph kai, to 1843, egkatastatheke sto idio diamerisma mazi tou. Tou ekane polles eroteseis kai diabase polla iatrika biblia gia na sterixei ten aphegese tou se sigoures baseis. E phantasia tou ton ekane na <>ekeino pou tha egraphe o Phrount to 1911 skhetika m' ena uparkto prosopo, ton proedro Sremper. Sto muthistorema uparkhei enas <>: Ekeinos pou kanei o kurios Gkoliantkin me ton eauto tou, ki ekeinos pou kanei me ton deutero eauto tou, auton pou tou <>ten idia tou te glossa. Phusika, uparkhei kai mia trite phone, ekeine tou aphegete, tou muthistoriographou. Olo to ergo, loipon, einai khtismeno os mia adiakope sunomilia anamesa se treis phones, pou demiourgoun mia esoterike aposunthese. Ta alla prosopa den antilambanontai ten uparxe tou <>: briskoun aplos aprepe te sunuparxe antiphatikon ekdeloseon kai kanoun o,ti mporoun gia n' apokleisoun ton Gkoliantkin ap' ten anthropine koinonia."˝
˙Sto ergo auto exetazetai to aionio zetema ton Plousion kai ton Phtokhon an delade uparkhoun, opos iskhurizontai merikoi, duo ratses khoristes, an oi anthropoi gennontai proorismenoi apo te Phuse alloi na menoun phtokhoi ki alloi na ginoun plousioi. To muthistorema auto os ergo koinoniko, einai antikeimeniko kai amerolepto, kai theoreitai to semantikotero ergo tou Ksenopoulou."Ä
˝Perigraphe:
Khalepi. E Nantia Mourentin egklobizetai sta khalasmata tou spitiou tes.
Mia bomba ekhei ekragei ste geitonia.
Dipla tes e mana tes nekre.
Pheugoun gia to agnosto, gia ten elpida.
E barka tous buthizetai.
E Nantia sozetai apo enan katoiko tou nesiou, ton nearo dikegoro Stephano Anastasiade.
Omos e pragmatike tes odusseia molis ekhei arkhisei.
Sten prospatheia tes gia epibiose empisteuetai agnostous kai brisketai kleismene me te bia se oiko anokhes.
E apognose, e adikia, e apelpisia ten pnigoun, ospou ste zoe tes emphanizetai o Buronas Benetes, pou sozei te Nantia apo to marturio tes zoes tes.
E mepos okhi;
Mia anatreptike istoria pathous kai misous, prodosias kai ekdikeses.
Se mia stigme sumbainoun ta panta.
Zoe kai Thanatos. Thanatos kai Zoe."Å
˛Me toute edo ten poietike sulloge, blepoume gia prote phora te romantike pleura tou suggraphea. Ta erotika tou poiemata, allote euaistheta kai truphera kai allote entona, phlogera, gemata pathos, umnoune te gunaikeia omorphia kai ton apoluto erota pou eite odegei sten katastrophe, eite ste lutrose. O antras tou, adunamos mprosta ste gunaikeia phuse, panta upotassetai ston akraio erotismo tes kai ste sagene tou kormiou tes kai ginetai etsi ermaio ton pathon tou. Anikanos n' antidrasei, anikanos n' antistathei, upoklinetai mprosta sten tromere duname tou erota. Alla o suggrapheas gnorizei oti o erotas gia ton erota einai enas asemantos problematismos kai bazei dipla tou ton polemo. San dialektikos pou einai, enonei te zoe me ton thanato, ton erota me ton polemo, kanontas tous ena ekrektiko zeugari, opou o enas den mporei na zesei khoris ton allon.
O polemistes tou -opos se ola tou ta erga- kaleitai na dosei makhe apenanti se uperterous antipalous s' ena teleios aphiloxeno, xeno kai ekhthriko periballon gi' auton. Pote omos den pephtei amakheti, pote den pephtei khoris na ta dosei ola. Polemaei me olo tou to einai, xerontas akome oti mporei kai na khasei. Prokeitai gia poiemata bgalmena kateutheian apo ten psukhe, peritekhna, kompsa, akraia pou esokleioun mesa tous enan Leibadite, enan Ritso, enan Elute, enan Kabaphe. Otan malista auta sunduazontai se mia polutele ekdose me pinakes pagkosmias klases apo to klasiko repertorio, kathos kai tou dikou mas Gianne Nikou, kathistoun te sugkekrimene ekdose ena eikastiko kai aisthetiko kompsotekhnema, ena pragmatiko diamanti gia kathe bibliotheke. (Apo ten parousiase sto opisthophullo tou bibliou)"Ç
